Package: qdrant
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, libunwind8, tzdata
Description: Qdrant vector database and similarity-search engine
 Qdrant is an open-source vector database and vector-similarity search engine.
 It exposes a REST API on 6333 and a gRPC API on 6334 and ships a built-in web
 dashboard. This package provides the qdrant server binary, its default
 configuration, and the web-UI static assets.
